lemetry coverage.\n\nBuilder order from today: J3 (c097372e), evidence-rules slice\n(a53e1464), DX-A1, remaining self-host items of e6a5cd22, c3034274,\n121a8913, J4, DX-A2, MVP S0 and S1, DX-B1, S2, S3, DX-B2, S4, S5, S6,\nJ1, J2, J5, DX-C1, DX-C2, then BR-11 to BR-14. J4 and the MVP slices\nare filed by the planner with plan 032 draft 3. The six parent requests\nclose when their child lands."}